# Reinstalled inside the image; never copy host build output or local state.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
client/dist
# Arcade game bundles are regenerated by `build:all` inside the image (don't ship
# stale host copies into the build context).
client/public/jsdos/bundles
**/*.log
data
# Keep tmp out of the build context entirely. The licensed Doom WADs live here but
# must NOT be baked into the image (it may be published). The image builds only the
# freely-distributable shareware bundles; the licensed doom/doom2/tnt/plutonia .jsdos
# are provided at RUNTIME via ARCADE_BUNDLE_DIR (bind-mount) — see docs/dev-notes.md
# + tmp/docker-compose.yml.
tmp

# VCS + tooling
.git
.gitignore
.agent-shell
.claude

# Large raw tileset packs kept locally but unused by the app (see .gitignore).
MetroCity
Modern_Interiors_Free
moderninteriors

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
